# ShopStream Elasticsearch Schema Reference

## Index Name
`products_index_v1`

## Mapping
```json
{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "title": { "type": "text" },
      "description": { "type": "text" },
      "price": { "type": "double" },
      "tags": { "type": "keyword" },
      "updatedAt": { "type": "date" },
      "embedding": {
        "type": "dense_vector",
        "dims": 384,
        "index": true,
        "similarity": "cosine"
      }
    }
  }
}
